-- Dire Maul (map 429), Warpwood Quarter (east wing): movement (2026-11-03).
--
-- All 449 east-wing spawns stood still except 30 random wanderers (no path anywhere). Ported like
-- the earlier dungeons: Pandaria 5.4.8 paths for the same guids, else AzerothCore paths, wander
-- radius and formations matched by entry and position. Bosses, Pusillin, Old Ironbark and the 11
-- Alzzin's Minions are left alone (their paths in the other databases are one-way event moves).
-- 52 patrols (paths 429000002+), 2 formations, 183 wanderers.
